      "s9"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Also in May 2025, he said that if confirmed he would support continued AI model testing, NIST sharing of results and standards development, and continued U.S. leadership on AI.",
     "sids": [
      "s10",
      "s11",
      "s15"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "In December 2025 official-role remarks and a January 2026 reported statement, he said AI can increase manufacturer competitiveness and attract investment in America.",
