   }
  },
  {
   "sid": "s15",
   "date": "2025-05-01",
   "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/CHRG-119shrg62324/html/CHRG-119shrg62324.htm",
   "text": "As stated above, Secretary Lutnick has expressed his belief that NIST should ensure American leadership on AI standards. AI industrial consensus energy standards need to be developed in coordination with industry and other agencies, such as the Department of Energy, if they are to be understood, trusted and utilized.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
